fresh-editor (FULL_VERSION) DIST; urgency=low

  ## fresh 0.5.2

  - Fresh is now licensed GPL-3.0-or-later, up from GPL-2.0-only (#3328).
  - Orchestrator mode: a bare `fresh`, with no file or flags, reopens the
    workspace you were last in, running as a background daemon (#3306).
  - New CLI commands: `workspace list` and `agent list/get/explain/wait/start`.
  - Confirmations are now a modal dialog with one button per outcome (#3320).
  - `Ctrl+Q` in a daemon session asks Detach / Quit / Cancel.
  - Tokyo Night and Gruvbox ship as built-in themes (#3107).
  - Search folds case by default everywhere (#3349).
  - Interrupted saves are recoverable on the next start (#3383).
  - Much faster JavaScript/TypeScript highlighting and a quieter idle
    daemon (#3418).
  - `echo 123 | fresh` opens the pipe instead of hanging (#3252).
  - A language server can no longer delete files through
    `workspace/applyEdit`.

  The complete upstream changelog is installed as
  /usr/share/doc/fresh-editor/changelog.gz and lives at
  https://github.com/sinelaw/fresh/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md
